{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A01", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum cooling‑off period that an NBFC must provide a borrower to exit a digital loan is one day.", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022515, "gen_latency_s": 1.0111404999915976, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2974, "output_tokens": 103, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00022515, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0014"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04236229999514762, "total_latency_s": 1.053601300009177, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A02", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "If data is processed outside India, the NBFC must delete that data from servers outside India and bring it back to India within 24 hours of processing.", "citations": ["D16_A_0019"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002307, "gen_latency_s": 0.760840000002645, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2984, "output_tokens": 119, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002307, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0019", "D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0017"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03714789998775814, "total_latency_s": 0.7980768000124954, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A03", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The cap on Default Loss Guarantee (DLG) cover is 5 % of the total amount disbursed from the loan portfolio at any given time.", "citations": ["D16_A_0024"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000228, "gen_latency_s": 1.0208692999876803, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3032, "output_tokens": 98, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000228, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0025", "D16_A_0024", "D16_A_0026", "D16_A_0004", "D16_A_0023"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03783090000797529, "total_latency_s": 1.0587975999951595, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A04", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC must report the digital lending apps (DLAs) it uses on the Centralised Information Management System (CIMS) portal of the Reserve Bank of India.", "citations": ["D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0021"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024585, "gen_latency_s": 0.8149545999913244, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3022, "output_tokens": 160, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00024585, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0021", "D16_A_0020", "D16_A_0013", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0019"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03798880000249483, "total_latency_s": 0.8530342000012752, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A05", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "When an LSP works with multiple lenders, it must provide the borrower with a digital view of all loan offers that match the borrower’s request, showing the name(s) of each lender, the loan amount, tenor, APR, monthly repayment obligation and any penal charges. The view must also disclose the names of any unmatched lenders and provide a link to the Know‑Your‑Customer (KFS) for each lender.", "citations": ["D16_A_0011", "D16_A_0012"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002721, "gen_latency_s": 1.3418927999882726, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2984, "output_tokens": 257, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002721, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0011", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0005", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03912329999729991, "total_latency_s": 1.3811217000038596, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A06", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Yes.  An NBFC may retain a reasonable one‑time processing fee if the borrower exits the digital loan during the cooling‑off period, provided the fee is disclosed upfront in the Knowledge and Financial Services (KFS).", "citations": ["D16_A_0016"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000247725, "gen_latency_s": 1.081701899995096, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2951, "output_tokens": 184, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000247725, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0015", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0018"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03968439999152906, "total_latency_s": 1.121488999997382, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A07", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No, a lending app (NBFC) is not allowed to access a borrower’s contact list or photos. The RBI Directions specify that NBFCs and their linked service providers must refrain from accessing mobile phone resources such as file and media, contact list, call logs, telephony functions, etc. Only a one‑time access to camera, microphone, or location is permitted for KYC/on‑boarding purposes with explicit consent.", "citations": ["D16_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000255375, "gen_latency_s": 1.005557399999816, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2981, "output_tokens": 202, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000255375, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0018", "D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.0414189000002807, "total_latency_s": 1.0470746999926632, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A08", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "If the NBFC or the LSP has not replied within 30 days of receiving the complaint, or rejects it wholly or partly and the borrower is not satisfied, the borrower may lodge a complaint through the RBI’s Complaint Management System (CMS) portal under the Reserve Bank‑Integrated Ombudsman Scheme or send a physical complaint to the Centralised Receipt and Processing Centre in Chandigarh.", "citations": ["D16_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024307499999999999, "gen_latency_s": 1.3120777999865822, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2961, "output_tokens": 166, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000243075, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D16_A_0017", "D16_A_0014", "D16_A_0012", "D16_A_0016", "D16_A_0021"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.038875099999131635, "total_latency_s": 1.3510646999930032, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A09", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A new payment aggregator must have a minimum net‑worth of ₹15 crore at the time of tendering its application for authorisation, and it must reach a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by the end of the third financial year after the grant of authorisation.", "citations": ["D06_A_0005"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000243375, "gen_latency_s": 1.024292299989611, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3025, "output_tokens": 151, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000243375, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0005", "D13_A_0006", "D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0006", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.036588999995728955, "total_latency_s": 1.060997300010058, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A10", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An entity carrying on only PA‑P business must apply for authorisation by December 31, 2025. If it fails to apply by that due date, it must intimate its bankers immediately and wind up its business by February 28, 2026.", "citations": ["D06_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023684999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.9359915999957593, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3014, "output_tokens": 132, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00023685, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0004", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0005", "D06_A_0017", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04689090000465512, "total_latency_s": 0.9829859000019496, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A11", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "A non‑bank payment aggregator must keep the funds collected on behalf of its merchants in a separate escrow account opened with a Scheduled Commercial Bank (SCB) in India. For a PA‑CB such accounts are referred to as Inward Collection Accounts (InCA) or Outward Collection Accounts (OCA) depending on the transaction type.", "citations": ["D06_A_0014"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023932499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.9745590999955311, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2971, "output_tokens": 151, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000239325, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0003", "D06_A_0014", "D06_A_0002", "D06_A_0013", "D11_A_0029"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.042436799994902685, "total_latency_s": 1.017094900002121, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A12", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": true, "answer": "Existing payment aggregators were required to reach a net‑worth of ₹15 crore by March 31, 2021 and a net‑worth of ₹25 crore by March 31, 2023.", "citations": ["D05_A_0003", "D05_A_0004"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00025035, "gen_latency_s": 1.8291814999975031, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3138, "output_tokens": 146, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00025035, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D05_A_0003", "D06_A_0005", "D05_A_0004", "D05_A_0005", "D05_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04578200000105426, "total_latency_s": 1.8750572000135435, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A13", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "For any digital payment transaction that is not a card‑present transaction, at least one of the authentication factors used must be dynamically created or proven – that is, the proof of possession of that factor must be unique to the transaction.", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023009999999999996, "gen_latency_s": 1.1043858999910299, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2948, "output_tokens": 126, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002301, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0006", "D09_A_0001", "D09_A_0000"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.038826200005132705, "total_latency_s": 1.1433169999945676, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A14", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "Payment system providers must comply with the RBI Authentication Mechanisms Directions, 2025 by April 01, 2026.", "citations": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002361, "gen_latency_s": 1.2882883999991463, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3080, "output_tokens": 113, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002361, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0000", "D10_A_0001", "D10_A_0002", "D09_A_0000", "D10_A_0005"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.04008160000375938, "total_latency_s": 1.328471399989212, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A15", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The directions require that the authentication factors used for a digital payment transaction be independent, so that the compromise of one factor does not affect the reliability of the other. (Principle c – Robust.)", "citations": ["D10_A_0002"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.0002415, "gen_latency_s": 1.3571541999990586, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3084, "output_tokens": 130, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002415, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D10_A_0002", "D09_A_0001", "D10_A_0000", "D13_A_0016", "D10_A_0001"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03380089999700431, "total_latency_s": 1.3910533000016585, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
