{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A17", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The minimum validity period of a Pre‑Paid Payment Instrument (PPI) is one year from the date of the last loading or reloading of the PPI.", "citations": ["D11_A_0032", "D11_A_0031"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00022439999999999998, "gen_latency_s": 0.8288452999986475, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2908, "output_tokens": 117, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.0002244, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0032", "D11_A_0033", "D11_A_0005", "D11_A_0036", "D11_A_0031"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.033295200002612546, "total_latency_s": 0.8622371999954339, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A18", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The maximum amount outstanding allowed in a full‑KYC prepaid payment instrument is ₹2,00,000.", "citations": ["D11_A_0018"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023317500000000002, "gen_latency_s": 1.4489912999997614, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3021, "output_tokens": 118, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000233175, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0018", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0020", "D11_A_0017", "D11_A_0019"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03674060000048485, "total_latency_s": 1.485843600006774, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A19", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No – a Small PPI may be used only to purchase goods or services. Neither cash withdrawal nor funds transfer is allowed.", "citations": ["D11_A_0003", "D11_A_0017"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00024165000000000002, "gen_latency_s": 1.399330000000191, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3026, "output_tokens": 145, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.00024165, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D11_A_0017", "D11_A_0016", "D11_A_0003", "D11_A_0019", "D11_A_0020"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.035095700004603714, "total_latency_s": 1.4345243999996455, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A20", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "An NBFC‑Account Aggregator must have a net owned fund of at least ₹2 crore, unless the Reserve Bank specifies a higher amount.", "citations": ["D13_A_0006"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000237675, "gen_latency_s": 1.2130601000098977, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3073, "output_tokens": 120, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000237675, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0006", "D13_A_0007", "D16_A_0023", "D13_A_0005", "D13_A_0012"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03563610000128392, "total_latency_s": 1.2488247000001138, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 1.0, "first_hit_rank": 1, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A21", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "No, an account aggregator (NBFC‑AA) is expressly prohibited from supporting payment transactions for its customers.", "citations": ["D13_A_0009"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.00023182499999999998, "gen_latency_s": 1.1064123999967705, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3039, "output_tokens": 109, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000231825, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D06_A_0002", "D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0009", "D14_A_0023", "D06_A_0003"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03252909998991527, "total_latency_s": 1.1390408000006573, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.3333333333333333, "first_hit_rank": 3, "gold_cited": true}
{"config": "A-hybrid-gptoss20b", "qid": "A22", "type": "answerable", "version_sensitive": false, "answer": "The consent must be a standardised consent artefact that contains:\n(1) identity of the customer and optional contact information;\n(2) the nature of the financial information requested;\n(3) purpose of collecting such information;\n(4) the identity of the recipients of the information, if any;\n(5) URL or other address to which notification needs to be sent every time the consent artefact is used to access information;\n(6) consent creation date, expiry date, identity and signature/digital signature of the NBFC‑AA; and\n(7) any other attribute as may be prescribed by the Reserve Bank.\nIt may be obtained in electronic form and must be capable of being logged, audited and verified.", "citations": ["D13_A_0010"], "refused": false, "refusal_reason": "", "invalid_citations": [], "superseded_cited": [], "injection_detected": false, "cost_usd": 0.000261675, "gen_latency_s": 0.9594334000139497, "rate_limit_wait_s": 0.0, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2981, "output_tokens": 223, "cache_read_input_tokens": 768, "billed_cost_usd": 0.000261675, "provider": "Groq", "via": "openrouter"}, "retrieved": ["D13_A_0012", "D13_A_0010", "D13_A_0011", "D13_A_0009", "D13_A_0008"], "retrieval_latency_s": 0.03602249998948537, "total_latency_s": 0.9955980000086129, "hit@5": 1, "rr@10": 0.5, "first_hit_rank": 2, "gold_cited": true}
